<title>UK: NordLB sets $200 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets $200 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was led by Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    20.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    20 DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.4	 PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
